                    {
                        "sense_id": "697a5652-a8c9-3187-826c-1ad61d13703d",
                        "entry_id": "0efb1b0e-f996-323f-b9e2-21d8714b8ef9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of вор (vor): female thief"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c125cebf-6732-4e54-b4ee-09f46afa3b2d",
                                "sense_id": "697a5652-a8c9-3187-826c-1ad61d13703d",
                                "text": "— Вы не сме́ете остава́ться здесь ни одно́й мину́ты! — кри́кнула Зинаи́да Фёдоровна и уда́рила ножо́м по таре́лке. — Вы воро́вка! Слы́шите?",
                                "translation": "\"You dare not stay here another minute!\" cried Zinaida Fyodorovna, and she struck the plate with her knife. \"You are a thief! Do you hear?\"",
                                "english": "\"You dare not stay here another minute!\" cried Zinaida Fyodorovna, and she struck the plate with her knife. \"You are a thief! Do you hear?\""
                            }
                        ]
